---
/** The Lab (the innerlab view of the client's design): where practice meets real life. */
import Layout from "../layouts/Practice.astro";

---
<Layout title="The Lab · The Practice" description="This is where practice meets your real life. Learn it in the Masterclass, work it through in the Coaching Lab, and grow alongside people doing the same work." path="/lab" nav="learn">
<section class="view" id="innerlab">
  <div class="phero">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Lab · Live it</p>
        <a class="incl" href="/app#membership">Included with The Practice membership</a>
        <h1>This is where practice meets your real life.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Bring what you’re facing this week. Learn it in the Masterclass, work it through in the Coaching Lab, and grow alongside people doing the same work.</p>
        <div class="ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="#lab-how">Explore the Lab <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#lab-compare">Academy or the Lab?</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ph photo hero-gfx"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="1120" src="/images/practice/lab-hero.webp" alt="A member at her desk watching Leah teach Notice, Choose, Practice on a live call"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band" id="lab-compare">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">The difference</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Academy teaches the skill. The Lab is where you use it.</h2>
      <div class="tablewrap">
        <table class="compare">
          <thead><tr><th></th><th><small>Learn it</small>Academy</th><th><small>Live it</small>The Lab</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th>What you get</th><td>Lessons and tools on demand</td><td class="hl">The Coaching Lab, the monthly Masterclass, and community</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Pace</th><td>On your own, when you have time</td><td class="hl">A weekly rhythm with people expecting you</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Focus</th><td>Understanding the concept</td><td class="hl">Applying it to your real situation</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Feedback</th><td>Self reflection in the app</td><td class="hl">From coaches and peers in real time</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Best for</th><td>Building the foundation</td><td class="hl">Making change stick</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band paper">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">What’s included</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Coaching, the Masterclass, feedback, community, progress.</h2>
      <div class="tiles">
        <div class="tile"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="563" src="/images/practice/lab-call.webp" alt="A live online group coaching call with members on screen"></div><div class="tb"><h4>The Coaching Lab</h4><p>Bring what you’re navigating this week and work it through with an InnerBoard coach. Rehearse the hard conversation, the boundary, the decision, before you need it.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="800" src="/images/practice/lab-masterclass.webp" alt="A member in a Practice Club sweatshirt taking notes during the monthly Masterclass"></div><div class="tb"><h4>The Masterclass</h4><p>One focused teaching each month, with the replay available through the end of the month.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="640" src="/images/practice/lab-feedback.webp" alt="A member getting feedback from a coach on a video call"></div><div class="tb"><h4>Feedback</h4><p>Hear what’s working and what to adjust, from coaches and peers.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="563" src="/images/practice/lab-community.webp" alt="Members laughing together over coffee at an outdoor table"></div><div class="tb"><h4>Community</h4><p>People doing the same work. You’re not doing this alone.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="563" src="/images/practice/lab-challenges.webp" alt="Leah in a Be Your Own Proof sweatshirt talking with a member at work"></div><div class="tb"><h4>Challenges</h4><p>Short focused sprints that put a skill into practice.</p></div></div>
        <div class="tile"><div class="ph photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="563" src="/images/practice/lab-progress.webp" alt="A member checking off her reps in a journal"></div><div class="tb"><h4>Progress</h4><p>Track your reps and see how you’re growing over time.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band" id="lab-how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Real situations. Real practice. Real change.</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><b>1</b><h4>Join the Coaching Lab</h4><p>Bring what you’re working on. Each month’s theme gives you a place to start.</p></li>
        <li><b>2</b><h4>Practice with support</h4><p>Live coaching and guided exercises built around your real situation.</p></li>
        <li><b>3</b><h4>Get feedback</h4><p>Learn and refine in real time.</p></li>
        <li><b>4</b><h4>Apply it in real life</h4><p>Use it between sessions, where it counts.</p></li>
        <li><b>5</b><h4>Track your progress</h4><p>Notice what’s changing and keep going.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="band navy on-navy">
    <div class="wrap closer"><h2>A better life<br>takes practice.</h2><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/app">Explore the Lab <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
